# Data layer

Flow: **WebService → Repository → Cubit → Screen**.

- New API calls: add method on `*_webservice.dart`, wrap in `*_repository.dart`, expose via cubit.
- Base URL: `AppConfig.baseUrl` after init, or `AppConstants.baseUrl` (aliased during transition). Never hardcode `repairo.icu` in new files.
- Auth header: `Authorization: Bearer <token>` via shared `ApiClient` in `lib/core/network/` when present; do not duplicate header maps in every webservice.
- Use `AppConstants.connectionTimeout` / `receiveTimeout` for HTTP clients.

## File naming

- `*_webservice.dart` / `*_webservices.dart` (existing mix—match sibling files in the same folder)
- `*_repository.dart`
- Models in `lib/data/models/`

## Typos (do not propagate in new code)

Existing folders use `Notiffications`, `allcaterories`, `requset_details_repository`—rename only in dedicated refactor PRs, not drive-by.
